Similarly, if you have UnitedHealthcare, ask which specific network and plan are accepted.

If you have Medicare Advantage or HealthSpring Medicare Advantage, ask the intake team to verify your particular plan and the individual therapist's participation. Acceptance of one Medicare Advantage product does not establish acceptance of every plan offered by the insurer.

